Replace the Linux UI stub with egui-winit + egui_glow (EGL via glutin)
matching AppFactory/WindowConfig patterns, and wire the Linux viewer
presenter to show soft-decoded CpuRgba8 frames plus winit→RemoteInput
mapping. Document how to run OpenUUYC gui and remaining connect-soak
blockers. Windows cfg paths unchanged; no push.
